BRIEFING.md

# `.claude/skills/` is this repo's operating procedure - the QA gate and the
# page conventions - so it versions alongside the site it gates. Excluded as
# CONTENTS rather than as a directory: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so `.claude/` plus `!.claude/skills/` would
# silently keep ignoring it. launch.json and settings.local.json are
# machine-local and stay out.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
